SetRefundDelay_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the admin
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the admin
    ├── when the delay is 1 to 3599 seconds
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the delay is 0 or at least 1 hour
        ├── it should store the delay
        ├── it should emit {RefundDelayUpdated}
        └── it should apply to positions already open
